<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="pf0" style="margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt;"><span class="cf01"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">We have received your request through the Insperity Educational and Adoption Assistance Program mailbox. The following links will help answer your adoption and educational assistance benefits questions.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class="pf0" style="margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt;"><span class="cf01"><span style="color: windowtext;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></span></span></p><p class="pf0" style="margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt;"><span class="cf01"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><font face="arial">For questions regarding Adoption Assistance, please refer to the Terms and Conditions fo</font>r the Adoption Assistance program below.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class="pf0" style="margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt;"><span class="cf01"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></span></p><p class="pf0" style="margin: 0cm;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><a href="https://portal.insperity.com/cs/nsp/SitePage/adoption_assistance_program"><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(47, 85, 151);">Adoption Assistance on Premier</span></a><span class="cf01"><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(47, 85, 151);"><o:p></o:p></span></span></font></p><p class="pf0" style="margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt;"><span class="cf01"><span style="color: windowtext;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></span></span></p><p class="pf0" style="margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt;"><span class="cf01"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Please refer to the Terms and Conditions and the FAQs below for the Educational Assistance Program.</font></span></p><p class="pf0" style="margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p class="pf0" style="margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://portal.insperity.com/cs/nsp/SitePage/educational_assistance" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-indent: 36pt;"><span style="color: rgb(47, 85, 151);"><font size="2">Educational Assistance Resources on Premier</font></span></a></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; margin-left: -36pt; text-indent: 36pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="pf0" style="margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span class="cf01">While we do not provide claim pre‐approvals or Educational Assistance claim reimbursement guarantees, the following are some parameters to determine if a course is eligible.</span><span style="color: rgb(38, 38, 38);"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class="pf0" style="margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="pf0" style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -18pt;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">·<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>The course/seminar/ conference/exam must be job-related for continuing education. In addition, you must provide proof of successful completion, proof of payment, and a description to be eligible for the reimbursement (up to $500 per calendar year).&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="pf0" style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -18pt;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">·<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>License renewal, certifications, and memberships are eligible upon course completion. We do not reimburse for subscriptions or memberships alone. However, you may re-submit a claim with a course taken and completed under the membership.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="pf0" style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></p><p class="pf0" style="margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span class="cf01">If you still have questions or your email requires an immediate answer, please reach out to the Insperity Contact Center, using the Case Number in the subject line above,&nbsp;</span>at 866-715-3552 (select Option1: Benefits) on weekdays between 7:00 a.m. and 7:00 p.m. Central Time<o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="pf0" style="margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></p><p class="pf0" style="margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span class="cf01">Thank you and have a wonderful day.</span><span class="cf01"><span style="color: windowtext;"><o:p></o:p></span></span></font></p><p class="pf0" style="margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt;"><span class="cf01"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class="pf0" style="margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt;"></p><p class="pf0" style="margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt;"><span class="cf01"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Insperity Education and Adoption Assistance Team</font></span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>